## Performance Fixes Applied (Runs 11–14)

| Fix | Before | After | Improvement |
|-----|--------|-------|-------------|
| Relevance interval | every 100 ticks | every **500 ticks** | 5× fewer scans |
| Relevance threshold | 0.1 | **0.3** | ~3× faster expiry |
| Discovery map cap | unbounded (~370k+) | **5,000 hard cap** | constant-time scans |
| `Relevance` timing | **85,541ms** / 5k | **295ms** / 5k | **290× faster** |
| Capability IDs | `String.to_atom` | **binary string** | atom table preserved |
| Discovery IDs | `String.to_atom` | **binary string** | atom table preserved |
| Atom table crash | at tick ~70k | **never** | 100k clean run |
| Stage-count keys | dynamic atoms | **static strings** | minor |

